// shapes.memql -- os namespace

/// Full projection of a v1:os:desktop row: the document, the revision it was written at, and who
/// it belongs to. Backs myDesktop, which is the only read.
///
/// `revision` is here because the client's last-writer-wins arithmetic is done against it, and a
/// concept field no shape projects does not reach a client at all -- it would leave the shell
/// stamping every save as revision 1.
@row
shape desktop desktopDocument {
  row.id
  ownerUserId
  revision
  document
  row.createdAt
}
